WEBVTT

00:06.980 --> 00:10.990
VISIT THE ANCIENT RETAINER THAT EXORCISES EVIL

00:07.610 --> 00:10.990
Visit the ancient retainer
that exorcises evil.

00:11.570 --> 00:13.950
This is Ms. Ibuki's newest prophecy?

00:13.950 --> 00:19.240
Yep. My mom said she has an idea
of who this ancient retainer could be.

00:19.370 --> 00:21.410
It seems like they have relations to witches.

00:21.000 --> 00:22.870
SEEMS LIKE

00:21.410 --> 00:24.940
There's something that this family
has been passing down for generations,

00:22.870 --> 00:27.000
SEEMS LIKE
SOMETHING

00:24.940 --> 00:29.130
and if we meet them, we might receive
something that'll help us fight warlocks.

00:27.000 --> 00:28.630
SEEMS LIKE
SOMETHING
MIGHT
SOMETHING

00:28.630 --> 00:30.380
SEEMS LIKE
SOMETHING
MIGHT
SOMETHING
MAYBE

00:29.130 --> 00:30.800
There're too many unknowns here.

00:30.800 --> 00:32.800
I don't really understand it, either.

00:32.800 --> 00:35.010
I was told to go and have a talk with them.

00:35.380 --> 00:38.050
<i>Could there be an item we can use
to fight against warlocks?</i>

00:38.050 --> 00:39.810
<i>If so, I would definitely like to acquire it.</i>

00:40.510 --> 00:43.180
<i>Mount Kanhachiya
is not that far away either.</i>

00:40.510 --> 00:43.180
MOUNT KANHACHIYA

00:43.730 --> 00:45.060
All right, let's go.

00:45.350 --> 00:47.100
I'm gonna bring my new pajamas.

00:47.100 --> 00:48.440
I wanna have a barbeque.

00:48.440 --> 00:50.070
How about chilling a watermelon
in the river?

00:50.230 --> 00:52.940
- Why are you guys in vacation mode?
- Because it's summer vacation.

00:53.070 --> 00:54.900
We're not going there to have fun.

00:54.900 --> 00:57.030
Wait, are we all going?
And spending the night?

00:57.030 --> 00:59.200
I know! Let's invite Nemu as well!

00:59.370 --> 01:00.830
Let's catch some rhino beetles!

01:00.830 --> 01:02.830
Let's make an itinerary, too.

02:37.090 --> 02:39.380
Wow, this is so fun.

02:39.630 --> 02:42.720
Riding on the train with everyone
and eating pocky. And Nemu is here, too!

02:39.630 --> 02:46.600
SUMMER DEMON

02:42.720 --> 02:46.310
This is just so awesome
that all my magic power might explode!

02:46.310 --> 02:47.520
That's a bit scary.

02:47.850 --> 02:49.560
Is it really okay that I tag along, too?

02:49.560 --> 02:51.770
Of course it's fine.
You'd be helping me a ton.

02:51.770 --> 02:54.980
A trip with three boys and one girl
is just way too dangerous.

02:54.980 --> 02:56.690
But we live together.

02:56.690 --> 02:59.200
Hey Nemu, did you bring a swimsuit?

02:59.200 --> 03:00.700
Oh. Yes.

03:00.700 --> 03:04.410
I-Is it a bikini? Or a o-one-piece?

03:08.830 --> 03:09.540
Bikini.

03:10.290 --> 03:11.790
Keep it down, Nico!

03:12.120 --> 03:14.750
I haven't seen her
having fun like that in a while.

03:14.750 --> 03:16.800
Well, we've been avoiding long trips.

03:16.800 --> 03:21.090
It'll be all right. Besides, we have
three familiars and an elite witch.

03:21.260 --> 03:22.430
You're right.

03:22.970 --> 03:25.600
Morihito, you've been
on edge for a while,

03:25.600 --> 03:27.640
so why don't you try taking it easy?

03:29.310 --> 03:32.810
Crested kingfisher, and the sound
of rare kindness, from familiar friend.

03:32.810 --> 03:33.850
By Morihito Otogi.

03:33.850 --> 03:35.440
Why are you reading a haiku?

03:35.440 --> 03:36.940
MT. KANHACHIYA STATION

03:38.650 --> 03:43.030
The person picking us up said
they're under a black umbrella.

03:46.450 --> 03:48.830
Is that them?

03:50.500 --> 03:52.080
Salutations.

03:53.210 --> 03:54.960
Such a beautiful person.

03:55.170 --> 03:56.920
Thank you for taking care of us.

03:57.630 --> 03:59.210
You must be Nico Wakatsuki and...

03:59.590 --> 04:01.380
her lowly servants.

04:01.420 --> 04:02.590
LOWLY SERVANTS

04:02.720 --> 04:04.300
What was that now?

04:04.300 --> 04:06.430
Oh, my apologies.

04:06.430 --> 04:09.270
Nico Wakatsuki and her underlings.

04:07.850 --> 04:09.270
UNDERLINGS

04:09.390 --> 04:10.470
Still kinda the same!

04:10.680 --> 04:12.480
My apologies again.

04:12.480 --> 04:15.350
Nico Wakatsuki and her lowly butlers?
Her lowly subordinates?

04:13.730 --> 04:14.600
LOWLY BUTLERS

04:14.600 --> 04:17.650
LOWLY BUTLERS
LOWLY SUBORDINATES

04:15.350 --> 04:17.650
Why do you keep attaching
"lowly" to the words?

04:17.940 --> 04:19.610
Who the hell are you?

04:19.690 --> 04:23.450
I am the only son
of the Kiryu household, Miharu Kiryu.

04:23.450 --> 04:25.160
I'm a third-year middle school student.

04:25.360 --> 04:26.240
Did he say "son"?

04:26.240 --> 04:27.700
You're a guy?

04:27.870 --> 04:30.410
I'm quite familiar with everyone here.

04:30.790 --> 04:32.370
Nemu from the Miyao family.

04:32.580 --> 04:34.370
Keigo, the werewolf.

04:34.460 --> 04:36.290
- And Kanshi, the kappa.
- I'm a tengu!

04:36.420 --> 04:40.250
And Morihito the ogre. I believe
you and Nico are dating, correct?

04:40.460 --> 04:42.300
What? We're not dating.

04:42.800 --> 04:46.800
Is that so? I'm terribly sorry.
It just had that kind of atmosphere.

04:47.090 --> 04:52.600
I see. So since this is your first trip together,
doesn't it seem like the others are in the way?

04:52.600 --> 04:53.810
<i>This guy...</i>

04:53.810 --> 04:57.310
<i>He says things he's really
not supposed to say in any situation.</i>

04:58.560 --> 05:00.570
Well, everyone's all feeling down now.

05:01.030 --> 05:02.860
I'm terribly sorry for...

05:02.860 --> 05:06.410
Do you think you can get away with anything
as long as you say, "I'm terribly sorry"?

05:06.410 --> 05:07.410
Miharu.

05:08.660 --> 05:11.330
We don't know anything about you.

05:11.830 --> 05:12.950
Can you tell us?

05:13.370 --> 05:15.500
What can we attain from coming here?

05:18.630 --> 05:21.500
We can talk when we arrive at my house.

05:21.880 --> 05:24.760
I'm here with my dad,
and we came by car. Please hop in.

05:26.470 --> 05:28.260
Oh my, though.

05:28.260 --> 05:30.300
Living all together must be something, huh?

05:30.300 --> 05:33.850
And you're all high schoolers,
with three guys and one girl?

05:33.850 --> 05:37.770
One can assume nothing happens, but then
again something could happen, right?

05:37.770 --> 05:39.730
He keeps coming
with things he shouldn't say.

05:39.730 --> 05:41.190
So did something happen?

05:41.190 --> 05:42.070
No!

05:42.070 --> 05:43.650
Oh, I see.

05:44.610 --> 05:47.780
I apologize for my son's rudeness.

05:48.320 --> 05:50.700
I am his father, Masumi Kiryu.

05:50.700 --> 05:52.370
Dad is scary!

05:52.700 --> 05:57.370
Nico's mother has taken care of us
quite well.

05:57.370 --> 06:01.880
So if we could help her daughter
in some way, I would be happy to assist.

06:02.090 --> 06:04.380
So, what do you do for a living?

06:04.380 --> 06:07.170
She's wondering
if you're in some kind of crime syndicate.

06:07.170 --> 06:08.760
You shush your mouth!

06:09.010 --> 06:10.760
I am a pastor.

06:12.010 --> 06:13.600
Why is everyone amazed?

06:13.600 --> 06:17.350
Has that profession been passed down
in the Kiryu family?

06:17.350 --> 06:21.150
No, that would be our side job.

06:21.480 --> 06:24.150
I am also an exorcist.

06:24.360 --> 06:25.530
An exorcist?

06:25.530 --> 06:30.660
Yes. By wielding my sword,
I can cut down evil beings.

06:31.200 --> 06:35.910
For example, lowly monsters
that prank people or possess them.

06:36.250 --> 06:40.790
Expelling such beings
is our secret family business.

06:41.460 --> 06:43.790
It is, effectively, exorcism.

06:44.250 --> 06:46.050
<i>A sword that cuts evil beings...</i>

06:46.420 --> 06:50.380
<i>That's definitely the effective weapon
that we need to fight warlocks.</i>

06:51.090 --> 06:52.800
Moi, look!

06:52.930 --> 06:55.260
It's a river. Let's go play there later.

06:55.260 --> 06:56.720
Nico, now's not the time for...

06:56.720 --> 06:59.940
- Anything biting?
- Damn it, she's not listening.

07:01.190 --> 07:06.190
We can talk anytime, so after we drop off
your luggage, please feel free to have fun.

07:07.400 --> 07:09.280
Wow, that's cold.

07:09.280 --> 07:13.450
Man, being outside in the summer
is the best. Gets you all hyped up!

07:13.910 --> 07:14.870
There!

07:16.330 --> 07:18.870
Oh, now you've done it. Take that!

07:19.120 --> 07:21.460
- Right back at ya!
- Woo, vacation time!

07:21.920 --> 07:23.830
Quit horsing around, you idiots!

07:27.380 --> 07:28.840
All the horns in the world couldn't...

07:31.680 --> 07:32.760
<i>This is pretty fun.</i>

07:34.090 --> 07:37.470
Geez, boys are so rowdy!

07:38.310 --> 07:40.850
You boys are acting like children!

07:42.940 --> 07:46.610
Oh my gosh, could you boys
please stop staring at us?

07:49.150 --> 07:52.110
Are you boys just looking at Nemu?

07:52.240 --> 07:54.660
Honestly, it's embarrassing
looking at either of you.

07:54.660 --> 07:57.120
Yeah, I really wonder what this feeling is.

08:21.640 --> 08:23.060
<i>Summer vacation...</i>

08:24.190 --> 08:25.310
<i>is so fun.</i>

08:28.230 --> 08:32.150
Stop it, Kan. Don't grab my leg.

08:32.360 --> 08:33.780
But I'm not doing anything.

08:35.030 --> 08:37.450
You really shouldn't get touchy
with girls without their permission.

08:37.450 --> 08:39.030
But I didn't do anything!

08:40.490 --> 08:42.910
This river is kinda weird.

08:43.370 --> 08:45.290
It's like the water is clinging on to me.

08:45.370 --> 08:47.250
My body feels heavy, too.

08:48.090 --> 08:49.750
Everyone, get out of the river!

08:50.050 --> 08:51.210
It's a warlock!

08:52.550 --> 08:54.130
I can't move my body!

08:54.130 --> 08:56.430
B-But the Alert didn't go off.

08:56.430 --> 08:59.430
Alert reacts to warlocks
if they're within a range of 200 meters.

08:59.430 --> 09:01.930
If they have a spell
that can reach further than that...

09:03.140 --> 09:04.310
Look, over there!

09:04.520 --> 09:06.190
It's that fisherman from earlier.

09:09.440 --> 09:15.030
If I use the flow of the river, m-my spells
will reach even from this distance.

09:15.280 --> 09:19.070
I-I-I've been waiting
for this chance for a while.

09:15.860 --> 09:19.070
WATER WARLOCK
RYOHEI FUCHI

09:21.290 --> 09:22.080
Alert!

09:26.960 --> 09:28.210
A warlock!

09:28.330 --> 09:30.290
So witches aren't just all women?

09:30.290 --> 09:33.010
The majority are women,
but there are witches who are men.

09:33.460 --> 09:36.720
I-I-It's my chance to start my life over.

09:36.930 --> 09:40.220
Y-You're gonna come with me,
Nico Wakatsuki!

09:40.430 --> 09:41.970
It's magic that controls water!

09:41.970 --> 09:42.930
Moi!

09:42.930 --> 09:45.350
Damn it, I can't move my lower body.

09:45.730 --> 09:48.270
<i>They both don't have their wands,
so they can't fly.</i>

09:48.270 --> 09:50.440
<i>Kanshi's fan
is with his clothes over there.</i>

09:50.610 --> 09:53.030
<i>So he aimed for a time
when we wouldn't have our weapons.</i>

09:53.230 --> 09:56.650
Ogre Qigong Fighting Style,
Lightning Burst!

10:00.320 --> 10:03.790
<i>I can't escape.
There's way too much river water.</i>

10:05.160 --> 10:07.160
It's useless!

10:07.370 --> 10:09.920
It scatters and changes flow and shape.

10:09.920 --> 10:13.300
Even if you make yourself small
with a spell, it'll swallow you up immediately.

10:13.630 --> 10:17.050
Water! Is the best!

10:18.050 --> 10:18.930
Nico!

10:19.550 --> 10:20.590
Moi!

10:22.510 --> 10:26.350
I-I-I've captured the Witch of Thousands!

10:26.350 --> 10:27.390
Nico!

10:27.390 --> 10:28.770
Moi...

10:30.400 --> 10:31.360
<i>What do I do?</i>

10:32.270 --> 10:33.400
<i>What do I do?!</i>

10:34.650 --> 10:35.690
<i>All right.</i>

10:36.320 --> 10:37.700
<i>I'll cut off my legs.</i>

10:39.700 --> 10:40.700
It's you.

10:40.820 --> 10:42.030
Miharu!

10:42.030 --> 10:46.040
I-I wanted to bring drinks
for everyone, and...

10:46.040 --> 10:47.250
You don't need to explain yourself!

10:47.250 --> 10:50.830
Read the room, would you?
Go get your dad right now!

10:51.000 --> 10:53.500
Your dad can cut this water!

10:54.090 --> 10:57.300
That old exorcist guy?
I know about him.

10:57.630 --> 10:59.510
D-D-Don't underestimate me.

10:59.510 --> 11:03.300
Th-Th-This isn't the kind of magic
that can be cut by that thing.

11:04.180 --> 11:05.220
Miharu!

11:05.350 --> 11:08.480
I'm sorry, but he's right.

11:08.810 --> 11:10.850
My father won't be able to do it.

11:11.310 --> 11:15.400
My father deals
with more low-level monsters.

11:15.570 --> 11:17.740
An evil magic like this...

11:20.610 --> 11:22.030
can only be cut by me!

11:26.120 --> 11:27.290
What?

11:33.460 --> 11:34.250
Nico!

11:34.540 --> 11:36.300
Ugh, that was so scary.

11:36.420 --> 11:39.050
Miharu, you also wield
a demon-repelling sword?

11:39.220 --> 11:41.930
No, I can use anything as a sword.

11:42.010 --> 11:44.430
The ability to expel evil
is a power that comes from within.

11:44.430 --> 11:47.930
Within our family, it manifested
the strongest with me.

11:48.180 --> 11:50.480
Ability? What are you...

11:50.480 --> 11:52.440
Before that, what should we do
with that guy?

11:52.440 --> 11:55.610
Should we slice him up
like roast beef and skewer him?

11:55.610 --> 11:57.690
You're so brutal!

11:58.730 --> 11:59.900
Oh, he's getting away.

11:59.900 --> 12:01.320
- It's fine.
- What?

12:03.820 --> 12:05.950
Our guard dog just ran after him.

12:05.950 --> 12:09.660
Get back here, you fish punk!

12:15.290 --> 12:17.960
H-How dare you...

12:18.630 --> 12:20.590
D-D-Damn it!

12:20.920 --> 12:25.010
I'll take all of you with me,
and kill you all!

12:36.980 --> 12:37.860
Miharu!

12:45.820 --> 12:47.490
Miharu!

12:48.580 --> 12:49.330
Miharu!

12:49.410 --> 12:50.490
Miharu!

12:54.790 --> 12:56.750
Nico, your healing magic!

12:58.000 --> 12:58.960
Nico!

12:58.960 --> 13:00.130
Wait.

13:00.920 --> 13:03.380
That won't heal me in time.

13:03.630 --> 13:05.010
Your arm...

13:13.060 --> 13:14.730
Wh-What?

13:14.730 --> 13:17.230
Ahh, this is great.

13:17.230 --> 13:18.020
Excuse me?

13:18.020 --> 13:19.690
Yes, yes!

13:19.690 --> 13:21.730
- What is this? Wow!
- What's happening?

13:21.730 --> 13:23.780
Morihito, yours is amazing!

13:23.780 --> 13:26.360
- What is?
- It's the best one so far.

13:26.360 --> 13:27.490
Please answer me!

13:28.990 --> 13:30.450
Dude, what the hell?

13:32.540 --> 13:33.790
H-His wound...

13:33.870 --> 13:35.410
It's getting healed.

13:40.250 --> 13:41.500
Oh, it got healed.

13:41.500 --> 13:42.550
No way.

13:43.710 --> 13:44.970
What happened?

13:44.970 --> 13:47.930
Wow, I thought I was gonna die there.

13:47.930 --> 13:51.180
But ogre energy was way more potent
than I expected, so it saved me.

13:52.010 --> 13:53.890
Okay, let's drink some juice.

13:53.890 --> 13:55.640
Let's see who chooses first
with rock-paper-scissors.

13:55.640 --> 13:58.310
Enough of that already!
Explain what just happened!

13:59.730 --> 14:02.320
This is my family's ability.

14:02.320 --> 14:05.820
I'm immortal as long as
I can siphon energy from people.

14:06.070 --> 14:09.370
Immortal? What the hell
is the Kiryu family?

14:13.290 --> 14:14.580
We're vampires.

14:14.750 --> 14:16.580
V-Vampires?

14:16.870 --> 14:19.750
Oh, but I still feel pain and everything.

14:19.750 --> 14:22.590
Man, that was the first time
I ever saw my small intestine!

14:22.590 --> 14:23.130
Gross!

14:23.130 --> 14:25.630
What the hell are you saying
with such a cute face?

14:31.260 --> 14:33.220
I'm terribly sorry.

14:33.220 --> 14:36.890
You were under my care, yet you all
just had a frightful experience.

14:36.890 --> 14:38.480
Lowkey, you're kinda frightful.

14:38.810 --> 14:42.730
But it's surprising to hear
that the Kiryu family are vampires.

14:43.020 --> 14:49.740
Yes. Just like you, our ancestors, who served
a witch, evolved over generations.

14:51.200 --> 14:53.740
We are bat familiars.

14:54.370 --> 14:59.620
Current day vampires don't suck blood.
We suck energy from the skin.

15:00.170 --> 15:02.880
For those who possess magic,
we take their magic power.

15:02.880 --> 15:08.880
If it's a normal human, we take
their vitality through a skill called Drain.

15:09.090 --> 15:12.180
But for someone like me,
who has a sliver of that power,

15:12.180 --> 15:16.770
my Drain is quite weak
and is mostly used for exorcism.

15:17.060 --> 15:18.520
However!

15:18.980 --> 15:23.400
Miharu was born into this era
wielding a powerful ability.

15:27.820 --> 15:31.530
His power will be able
to defeat even a warlock!

15:31.530 --> 15:36.410
Th-Th-That's all the information
I can tell you.

15:36.620 --> 15:42.120
A s-s-strange man approached me,
and I only did it for the money.

15:42.120 --> 15:43.540
So just kill me if you want!

15:44.750 --> 15:49.760
Morihito, I can dispose of him
if you give me the order.

15:51.470 --> 15:53.010
You can't, Moi!

15:53.010 --> 15:55.300
You cannot take someone's life.

15:56.060 --> 15:59.890
My mission is to protect Nico
from warlocks. And so...

15:59.890 --> 16:01.100
Please stop!

16:01.640 --> 16:04.060
I feel terrible for what happened
to the enchanter.

16:04.360 --> 16:08.570
She passed away because she lived beyond
her years and her magic was taken from her.

16:08.860 --> 16:11.820
It's not something that we should decide.

16:15.990 --> 16:17.160
Mr. Kiryu.

16:17.620 --> 16:20.330
Vampires can siphon
magic powers, correct?

16:20.330 --> 16:24.540
Can we not siphon his magic powers
and neutralize him?

16:24.540 --> 16:28.380
It would be impossible for me,
but Miharu will be able to do it.

16:29.050 --> 16:33.840
However, a great amount of life energy
will also get taken at the same time,

16:33.840 --> 16:36.850
and that would most likely
cause this man to die.

16:38.180 --> 16:40.270
I am the Witch of Thousands.

16:40.270 --> 16:42.310
I can use healing magic.

16:42.310 --> 16:45.730
While Miharu siphons his magic power,

16:45.730 --> 16:50.230
I can heal him with my spell, and maybe
we can neutralize him without taking his life.

16:51.150 --> 16:51.940
I see.

16:51.940 --> 16:54.320
I think it's worth trying.

16:55.490 --> 16:56.870
Let's try it, Miharu.

16:56.870 --> 16:59.240
It's a collab
between a vampire and a witch.

17:01.200 --> 17:03.410
But wouldn't you rather see
his body become all wrinkly

17:03.410 --> 17:08.290
as his magic power is taken, while his eyes
become purified as he slowly dies?

17:08.290 --> 17:09.960
Why do you say such gross things?

17:09.960 --> 17:11.550
You ruined the momentum!

17:11.550 --> 17:12.800
I'm just kidding.

17:13.220 --> 17:15.510
Cure Care Revitalization!

17:18.430 --> 17:19.390
Amazing.

17:19.390 --> 17:23.140
They're offsetting the damage
while taking magic energy.

17:24.310 --> 17:26.980
<i>Is this what the prophecy
was talking about?</i>

17:30.690 --> 17:31.820
You did it!

17:35.860 --> 17:37.240
Here, take some of my energy.

17:37.240 --> 17:38.530
Thank you for the meal.

17:38.530 --> 17:41.080
Nico, here's a dorayaki
with lots of red bean paste.

17:42.160 --> 17:44.500
This recovery scene is so chaotic.

17:45.290 --> 17:51.170
M-M-My magic is gone.
D-D-Did I become a normal human?

17:51.170 --> 17:54.840
Did misfortune befall you because
you had witch blood flowing through you?

17:54.840 --> 17:58.220
Or was it the life you led that
attracted the darkness to you?

17:58.930 --> 18:02.260
M-My... My life was...

18:03.720 --> 18:07.520
Not there!
Why can't you follow simple orders?

18:07.690 --> 18:09.610
You're such an idiot.

18:10.860 --> 18:14.280
MOU MOU FINANCE

18:11.150 --> 18:14.280
Y-Y-Yes, I did become
the cosigner for that.

18:14.740 --> 18:16.820
B-But they promised
never to trouble me about it.

18:16.820 --> 18:19.660
<i>Well, you're obligated to pay us back.</i>

18:19.660 --> 18:23.290
<i>Did you get scammed?
I bet you get called "idiot" a lot.</i>

18:24.870 --> 18:28.330
Did you know?
Whales aren't really fish.

18:29.120 --> 18:31.590
Ow! What the hell, you idiot!

18:33.800 --> 18:36.420
Y-Yeah, I might be an idiot.

18:36.920 --> 18:40.800
I can't do anything well,
and no one cares about me.

18:40.930 --> 18:42.680
But it can't be helped.

18:42.680 --> 18:45.220
That's just how I was born.

18:52.110 --> 18:55.280
<i>Is it my fault? Or is it the world's?</i>

18:56.400 --> 19:00.030
<i>Hate, hate, hate!
I don't want to die!</i>

19:05.700 --> 19:07.290
Water Warlock.

19:08.040 --> 19:10.670
I shall teach you how to use your powers.

19:11.630 --> 19:16.880
I was t-t-told that a witch's powers
had awakened within me.

19:17.050 --> 19:20.970
S-S-So we teamed up, and if I captured
the Witch of Thousands,

19:20.970 --> 19:24.310
I'd be given a lot of money,
and I could start my life over.

19:24.970 --> 19:29.310
And then, I-I-I could show those people
who made fun of me, and...

19:30.850 --> 19:35.320
Do not seek to understand your
circumstances. All is within God's plan.

19:35.650 --> 19:39.450
Perhaps you can stay here in these lands,
and begin devoting yourself to others.

19:39.450 --> 19:42.660
If you would like to start over,
I can lend you a hand.

19:57.090 --> 19:59.050
Ever since I was ten,

19:59.050 --> 20:02.430
I started feeling a different hunger
than the one coming from my stomach.

20:02.640 --> 20:06.930
I was driven by this impulse
to suck energy from people.

20:07.140 --> 20:11.730
At first, I received some from my father,
and secretly from my friends.

20:12.440 --> 20:15.980
But those friends would temporarily
lose vigor for a little bit,

20:16.520 --> 20:19.740
so I only took a little at a time.

20:20.110 --> 20:25.620
However, the amount of energy I needed
kept growing, so I mostly took from my father.

20:26.280 --> 20:30.200
It seems like a family of familiars
has more life energy than normal.

20:30.200 --> 20:32.160
Is there no effect on your dad?

20:32.290 --> 20:33.870
Please look at this.

20:34.080 --> 20:37.170
This is my father from five years ago,
when I started siphoning his energy.

20:37.170 --> 20:38.630
Young dad!

20:38.630 --> 20:39.550
He looks like this now.

20:39.550 --> 20:41.630
So that was from you taking his energy!

20:41.760 --> 20:43.930
I mean, I thought
he looked pretty old, but...

20:43.930 --> 20:46.010
I first thought he was your grandfather.

20:46.010 --> 20:48.720
So it was from taking too much energy...

20:48.720 --> 20:51.350
And it's been giving me some anxiety.

20:51.350 --> 20:56.770
It seems like I need the most energy during
puberty, so the hunger only increases.

20:56.940 --> 20:59.280
But my father looks like this right now.

20:59.280 --> 21:00.110
Are you teasing him?

21:00.110 --> 21:02.110
It's your fault he became like this!

21:02.280 --> 21:03.700
It's okay, Miharu.

21:03.700 --> 21:04.820
Dad's way too nice!

21:05.030 --> 21:07.160
Please, it's not my son's fault.

21:07.580 --> 21:10.290
It's only natural that the parents
take responsibility.

21:10.290 --> 21:11.910
Suddenly appearing mom is beautiful!

21:11.910 --> 21:14.710
I bet she's never had a drop of energy
siphoned from her!

21:15.330 --> 21:16.830
And so I've made a decision.

21:17.170 --> 21:21.300
I'll increase the hours I sleep,
lessen the activities I do during the day,

21:21.300 --> 21:23.470
and conserve energy that way.

21:23.470 --> 21:25.590
Can vampires do that?

21:25.840 --> 21:30.470
We can, and I was thinking about
going to a high school with night classes,

21:30.720 --> 21:34.060
or maybe just not go to high school at all.

21:36.810 --> 21:37.770
Miharu.

21:38.440 --> 21:41.900
If it's all right with you,
would you like to come live at my house?

21:43.030 --> 21:47.110
I thought the prophecy was pointing
to an item that would defeat warlocks.

21:47.700 --> 21:49.530
But I know what it is now.

21:49.950 --> 21:53.790
What we needed was a way
to defeat warlocks without killing them.

21:54.460 --> 21:56.580
You were that item.

21:58.670 --> 22:01.090
Yes, I think this is a great idea!

22:01.420 --> 22:03.420
And next year, you can apply
to the high school we go to!

22:03.420 --> 22:05.260
Oh, but I would still need...

22:05.260 --> 22:06.590
That won't be a problem.

22:06.930 --> 22:10.800
Regarding Drain, we have three
at the house who're full of energy.

22:11.850 --> 22:13.350
You should go.

22:14.020 --> 22:19.310
It was hurting my heart
to see you avoid your friends.

22:19.610 --> 22:22.610
And it hurts to hear you say
that you'll give up high school.

22:23.530 --> 22:30.200
I'm sorry, I just wanted you to live
like a normal human as much as possible.

22:30.490 --> 22:35.540
But it seems like fate is something that
you shouldn't force yourself to fight,

22:35.540 --> 22:38.370
but instead accept it and have fun.

22:41.500 --> 22:43.090
We will miss you.

22:47.800 --> 22:51.180
If he doesn't talk,
he's adorable as hell.

22:53.760 --> 22:56.770
Please take good care of him.

22:57.730 --> 23:03.690
So, when I'm siphoning energy,
that person's thoughts also come flowing in.

23:04.480 --> 23:11.160
Feelings of the small guilt you have towards me,
and also this warm and deep love...

23:11.490 --> 23:14.870
Feelings of how you still look at Mom
as a woman, even at your age...

23:14.870 --> 23:16.540
Again, you don't have to say that!

23:17.410 --> 23:20.170
I understand all of it, okay? I'll see you!

23:20.540 --> 23:21.420
Miharu!

23:21.500 --> 23:23.670
Miharu. Miharu!

23:24.170 --> 23:27.300
Come on, Mom, Dad. I'll get all sad.

23:27.300 --> 23:28.670
Watch out for that boar!

23:29.930 --> 23:31.220
There's so much blood!

23:31.220 --> 23:33.220
- Morihito, please help him!
- Coming.

23:33.220 --> 23:37.350
Wait, before you do that, I want to see
how gross my wound looks.

23:37.350 --> 23:39.850
Would you please stop that already?

23:41.150 --> 23:45.070
You see, I'm immortal,
so I throw caution to the wind a lot.

23:45.070 --> 23:48.570
Take care of yourself more!
Or else something bad will happen.

23:51.660 --> 23:55.870
<i>The vampire Miharu Kiryu has also
moved into the Otogi household!</i>

23:57.540 --> 23:59.040
Hello, I'm Miharu Kiryu.

23:59.040 --> 24:01.870
There's someone younger than us,
so he's like a cute little brother.

24:01.870 --> 24:06.460
So living together with three guys and
one girl is seriously a dangerous situation.

24:06.170 --> 24:12.010
NEXT EPISODE
MIHARU KIRYU, THE VAMPIRE
MISSING PARASOL
I'M SO GLAD YOU'RE HERE

24:06.460 --> 24:08.670
Does the school know about this?

24:08.670 --> 24:10.050
Doesn't anything happen?

24:10.050 --> 24:11.800
Not cute at all.
